WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.823
Shown at 1.25x speed. Back to That Place: an interactive memory App with a synthetic example and local notebooks.

2
00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:16.061
Three fictional contributors. Agent organization is explicitly preset, not live AI.

3
00:00:16.101 --> 00:00:37.564
After source review, open the first real World Labs output, generated in advance.

4
00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:49.343
Actual camera movement and exploration, with an archived panorama alternative.

5
00:00:49.383 --> 00:01:18.094
Add the remembered red bicycle: a second independent generation; the first version remains.

6
00:01:18.134 --> 00:01:31.198
Create a local project with free text and a captioned image. Nothing is uploaded.

7
00:01:31.238 --> 00:01:46.113
Source quotations and manual editing; a description draft survives refresh.

8
00:01:46.153 --> 00:01:53.920
Confirmation history is saved. Online AI, remote collaboration and new-world generation are not enabled.
